  "Description": {
    "Cost": 8566980,
    "UIName": "Iron Cheetah",
    "Id": "chassisdef_iron_cheetah_ICH-Prime",
    "Name": "Iron Cheetah",
    "Details": "The last OmniMech created by Clan Smoke Jaguar, the Iron Cheetah is the pinnacle of their OmniMech design line. Building upon the success of the Dire Wolf, the clan engineers created a brutal and efficient killer. By using an Endo Steel chassis, a 400 XL engine and 16 ton of Ferro-Fibrous armor, the largest weakness of the Dire Wolf - its slow speed - was corrected, yet still leaving an impressive 39.5 tons of free pod space. The Prime configuration uses this space to mount two ER PPC, two Medium Pulse Lasers, one Gauss Rifle and an Artemis IV-enabled LRM15. For close range defense it also carries an ER small laser and an AMS system.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_ironcheetah"
  },
